# Optional LMCache pull requests to cherry-pick before patches/lmcache/*.patch.
#
# One PR per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Formats:
#   3008
#   origin 3008
#   upstream=https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache.git 3008
#
# For existing remotes, use:
#   <remote-name> <pr-number>
#
# For remotes not already configured in the image build clone, use:
#   <remote-name>=<remote-url> <pr-number>
#
# Inline remote URLs must be GitHub repository URLs, and alternate remotes must
# expose GitHub-style `refs/pull/<pr-number>/head` refs. Stacked PRs are
# allowed: dependency commits not already present will be cherry-picked first.

